```

### Breaking Change Policy

| Change Type | Version Bump | Migration |
|-------------|--------------|-----------|
| Add new token | Patch (1.0.x) | None |
| Change token value | Minor (1.x.0) | Optional |
| Rename/remove token | Major (x.0.0) | Required |

